{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1535691-shallow-graves-a-player-s-guide-to-deviant-the-renegades","id":1535691,"title":"Shallow Graves - A Player's Guide to Deviant: The Renegades","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Deviant: The Renegades"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-15T16:24:33-07:00","id":1535691,"title":"Shallow Graves - A Player's Guide to Deviant: The Renegades","content":"You <i>may</i> have heard that with the publication of <b>Clade Companion</b>, <b>Deviant: The Renegades</b> is now (or very soon will be) a dead game line. But these are <i>Renegades</i> we're talking about. You should never believe they're dead unless you see a body - and even then, you'd be within your right mind to wake up in a cold sweat some nights, wondering if perhaps they had Rapid Healing 5 or were a secret Myriad. If you create a Deviant and they go Renegade, you don't get to decide that you are done with them, because unless they are really, <i>truly</i> dead, you can be quite certain that <i>they</i> are not done with <i>you</i>!<br /> <br /> In case you don't know me, I was the co-developer of <b>Deviant: The Renegades</b> and the line developer for it after that. Because the IP owner stopped approving new <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> projects, I have decided to continue the <b>Deviant</b> line on the Storyteller's Vault. My first offering, which is currently in 1st proofs, is <b>Shallow Graves</b> - a Deviant Player's Guide packed with more character options than you can shake a stick at (perhaps because if you shake a stick at it, it may break out of its cage and rip your arm off). I anticipate a full release this summer, and in anticipation of that, I will be sharing excerpts of the text a couple of times a week until release day - starting tomorrow.<br /> <br /> Today? Today is just a warning - this supplement affirming a few Touchstones before it begins the <i>real</i> work of bringing down the Web of Pain. Okay, actually, today is a cover reveal to show you what's coming:<br /> <br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?attachments/shallow-graves-cover-png.49858/&amp;hash=f1c412a205ea645d1bcd3a27b5db4366\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?attachments/shallow-graves-cover-png.49858/&amp;hash=f1c412a205ea645d1bcd3a27b5db4366\" data-thumb-url=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?attachments/shallow-graves-cover-png.49858/&amp;hash=f1c412a205ea645d1bcd3a27b5db4366\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/4/patreon-media/p/post/104270894/7c493d96922e4575983d163c7f2101e7/eyJxIjoxMDAsIndlYnAiOjB9/1.png?token-time=1717027200&amp;token-hash=4c2yf6tIfeqHKMOC3nlpb3VfuwLwBHtaj4nMAWk8vjE%3D\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/4/patreon-media/p/post/104270894/7c493d96922e4575983d163c7f2101e7/eyJxIjoxMDAsIndlYnAiOjB9/1.png?token-time=1717027200&amp;token-hash=4c2yf6tIfeqHKMOC3nlpb3VfuwLwBHtaj4nMAWk8vjE%3D\" data-thumb-url=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/4/patreon-media/p/post/104270894/7c493d96922e4575983d163c7f2101e7/eyJxIjoxMDAsIndlYnAiOjB9/1.png?token-time=1717027200&amp;token-hash=4c2yf6tIfeqHKMOC3nlpb3VfuwLwBHtaj4nMAWk8vjE%3D\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?attachments/shallow-graves-back-cover-png.49859/&amp;hash=f1c41