www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":9},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T18:48:14-07:00","id":1535699,"title":"","content":"Looks very promising. Thank you and your fellow writers and artists for for doing this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T19:35:38-07:00","id":1535700,"title":"","content":"that's so wonderful to hear!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T20:25:56-07:00","id":1535701,"title":"","content":"I do hope the line continues to be profitable enough for you to continue it for some time to come.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-15T20:58:14-07:00","id":1535702,"title":"","content":"I'm excited for this. <br /> <br /> Also, a heads up your fantasy author link doesn't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-16T04:05:37-07:00","id":1535709,"title":"","content":"Today, I'm going to spoil a little bit of the chapter fiction. Fiction in <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> games has long served as a way to convey the mood of the game and the kinds of stories to be told with it. In some cases, it also showcases some of the new powers and narrative tools a supplement will put at a troupe's disposal. The <b>Shallow Graves</b> fiction is a novella in eight parts - one for the introduction (<a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">which you can read for free here</a>), and one for each of the seven chapters.<br /> <br /> Next week, I'll be posting some excerpts from Chapter 1, which is a deep dive into roleplaying a Renegade.<br /> <br /> <b>People Who Died</b><br /> <br /> <b>Part I</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Mathias sat on the balcony of his house overlooking his pool. Beyond the tall privacy fence surrounding it stretched a small forest, and past that \u2014 just before the horizon \u2014 he could make out the Gulf of Mexico. The sun hung low over the water, not yet a sunset but the promise of a beautiful one.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">He glanced to his left at the other chair. It was empty. It had been empty for years \u2014 ever since cancer took Julie. Mathias knew his wife would have enjoyed watching the sunset with him.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Gripping the arms of his chair, he hoisted himself to his feet. He was by no means old \u2014 not yet 50, with a bare pate covered by a Marlins baseball cap. His hair had been buzzed short his entire adult life, so shaving it once his hairline had begun to recede seemed an obvious choice.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Mathias picked up the empty margarita glass. There was plenty of time to get another drink. He went inside, set the glass on the beautiful granite countertop, and opened the stainless-steel finished refrigerator. He had replaced all the kitchen appliances a year ago, after a particularly lucrative consulting gig.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cMajor Mathias Washington,\u201d said a woman\u2019s voice behind him.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">He spun, brandishing a half-empty, plastic margarita bottle like a weapon. His guns were in his bedroom, locked in a gun cabinet. The front door had sturdy locks to buy time for him to get them.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">If the woman framed in the doorway to his living room regarded him as a threat, she gave no sign of it. She was short and slight, with dusky features and long black hair. She looked to be in her 20s or early 30s and wore a black T-shirt, blue jeans, and sneakers.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Mathias deliberately set down the bottle on the counter next to the margarita glass. And the block of kitchen knives, in case it came to that. How had she gotten into the house?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cWhat do you want?\u201d he demanded.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cMe? From you? Nothing.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">He placed the accent as Afghan.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cMy friends, however\u2026\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">She made a small motion with one hand, and a circular hole ringed in black fire opened in the space between her and Mathias. A white man and a tall black woman, both of them in their 30s, stepped out of the portal. He didn\u2019t bother taking in more of their appearance than that as he reached for the French chef\u2019s knife.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cNo,\u201d said the man, and Mathias\u2019s hand struck an invisible barrier.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cWeingarten,\u201d the major said.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Then an unseen fist closed around Mathias, pinning his arms and legs and lifting him a foot off the floor. He wriggled futilely.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">The man, who wore crooked black glasses, offered a small, cold smile. \u201cI knew you\u2019d remember me, Major. I certainly remember you.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cClarence Weingarten,\u201d Mathias said by way of acknowledgment.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201c<i>Monty</i> Weingarten. Clarence was my grandfather\u2019s name.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Mathias managed a shrug despite the bonds holding him. \u201cWho are your friends?\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cAnd I knew you wouldn\u2019t remember me,\u201d said the black woman, stepping forward. Her right arm hung by her side, swaying slightly with the movement as though it were a dead thing. \u201cKenya Moses. One of your Tailored Xenetics buddies\u2019 failed experiments. There were nine of us for every Monty.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">No recognition in the major\u2019s eyes.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cThree hundred soldiers died, sir.\u201d Her fury was thick despite the softness of her voice. \u201c300 more of us ended up like this.\u201d She gestured at her limp right arm.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cWhich is why I shut the program down,\u201d Mathias reminded them. When they didn\u2019t immediately respond, he continued. \u201cI assume your Afghan friend is another Tailored Xenetics success story?\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">The black fire portal abruptly vanished.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cYes,\u201d the woman in the jeans said. \u201cAfter they killed and maimed hundreds of Americans in their experiments, they killed and maimed thousands of Afghans, luring us with promises of giving us the tools we\u2019d need to fight the Taliban. Then they sold those same tools to our enemies.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cI had nothing to do with any of that,\u201d Mathias told her. \u201cAnd I had no idea they were in bed with the Taliban. Look, I\u2019m not your enemy here.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cYou\u2019re lying,\u201d Monty cut in. \u201cYou\u2019ve never met Zafir, but we know you\u2019re still doing work for Tailored Xenetics.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cI\u2019m just a consultant,\u201d Mathias stammered. \u201cI know nothing about their inner workings.\u201d</span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Fear. The fear of the animal as the door to the trap slams shut.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cAh, but we know you\u2019re working on a project with Michael Swan,\u201d Monty told him.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cYou want to know where he lives?\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cWe already know that,\u201d Kenya said.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cWe want the names of his friends within the organization,\u201d Monty clarified. \u201cWe want what you know about his handlers.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">\u201cNo one can handle Swan but you, Weingarten. I wish you\u2019d reconsider their offer.\u201d</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Mathias grunted as the invisible fist tightened around him until he could barely breathe.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"color:#00000a\">Monty\u2019s voice shook with rage as he spoke. \u201cWe\u2019re not doing this again.\u201d</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-16T08:03:16-07:00","id":1535731,"title":"","content":"You know what I've said before. You write it and I will buy it. Glad to hear your planned release is so soon Eric.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-17T11:45:27-07:00","id":1535783,"title":"","content":"The next excerpts won't go up until Tuesday, but I've been asked to provide a &quot;set list&quot; of Variations and Scars in the meantime, so here is that and more:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>New Adaptations</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Universal:</b> Clean, Desperation, Practical, Talented, Unbridled Passion<br /> <br /> <b>Cephalist:</b> Disciplined, Empath, Intent<br /> <br /> <b>Chimeric:</b> Attack Dog, Ferocious, Pack Leader<br /> <br /> <b>Coactive:</b> Foil, Null, Tolerant<br /> <br /> <b>Invasive:</b> Artisan, Obsessive, Reservoir<br /> <br /> <b>Mutant:</b> Evolve, Fountain, Unchanging<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><b>New Forms</b></span><br /> <br /> Advanced versions of Amalgam, Self-Made, Symbiote, and Transmissible much like the new Forms in <b>Clade Companion</b><br /> <br /> Allayed, Ambivalent, Dedicated, Summoner, Transitional<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Variations</span></b><br /> <br /> <b>Inspired Variations (all Universal):</b> Aerokinesis, Chronological Alignment, Dream Invader, Gravity Reduction, Hydrokinesis, Magnetic Control, Sticky Filaments, Stretching, Terrakinesis, Tool Mastery<br /> <br /> <b>Universal:</b> Conjuration, Cryokinesis, Delude, Extra Appendages, Fate-Bind, Gravity Intensification, Internet Acuity, Matter Control, Occult Singularity, Opener of Ways, Plant Control, Refuge, Shadow Command, Traumavore, Vocalization<br /> <br /> <b>Cephalist:</b> Clairvoyance, Emotion Amplification<br /> <br /> <b>Chimeric:</b> Beast Mastery, Body Modification<br /> <br /> <b>Coactive:</b> Emulate, Soul Seer<br /> <br /> <b>Invasive:</b> Matter Emulation, Mechanical Transformation<br /> <br